{"id":"wb-8-171","name":"沙岭墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"沙岭墓群","text":"沙岭墓群是一座北魏古墓葬，位于山西省大同市平城区南郊水泊寺乡沙岭村东北约500米。\n2011年10月24日，沙岭壁画墓公布为大同市文物保护单位Ⅱ—2。2016年6月6日，沙岭墓群公布为第五批山西省文物保护单位，分类古墓葬，时代为北魏。2019年，沙岭墓群公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位，编号8-0171-2-004。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%99%E5%B2%AD%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":86785538,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86785538","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d7e75929561bde232f89ed3f.jpg","title":"Datong_Shaling_Tomb_mural_2.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Datong_Shaling_Tomb_mural_2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/Datong_Shaling_Tomb_mural_2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Ancient Chinese Tomb Mural Painter","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​大同沙岭北魏壁画墓壁画","width":320,"height":351}}